<view class="policy-page">
  <view class="policy-hero">
    <view class="policy-nav"><button bindtap="back">‹</button><view><text>政策中心</text><small>POLICY CENTER</small></view><text class="policy-nav-mark">权威发布</text></view>
    <view class="policy-hero-copy"><text>让惠农政策看得懂、找得到、办得成</text><small>汇集棉花生产相关政策、申报提醒与通俗解读</small></view>
    <view class="policy-search"><text>⌕</text><input value="{{keyword}}" bindinput="onSearch" placeholder="搜索政策、补贴、保险、品种……"/><text wx:if="{{keyword}}" bindtap="clearSearch">×</text></view>
  </view>

  <view class="demo-tip"><text>说明</text><view>当前为产品演示数据，正式政策以政府部门发布的原文为准。</view></view>

  <scroll-view class="level-tabs" scroll-x enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="level-tabs-inner"><button wx:for="{{levels}}" wx:key="*this" class="{{activeLevel===item?'on':''}}" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="onLevel">{{item}}</button></view></scroll-view>
  <scroll-view class="category-tabs" scroll-x enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="category-tabs-inner"><button wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="*this" class="{{activeCategory===item?'on':''}}" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="onCategory">{{item}}</button></view></scroll-view>

  <view class="policy-result-head"><text>政策动态</text><small>共 {{visible.length}} 条</small></view>
  <view class="empty-policy" wx:if="{{!visible.length}}"><text>暂未找到相关政策</text><small>试试其他地区、分类或关键词</small></view>
  <view class="policy-list" wx:else>
    <view class="policy-card" wx:for="{{visible}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="openDetail" data-id="{{item.id}}">
      <view class="policy-card-top"><view><text class="level-tag">{{item.level}}</text><text class="category-tag">{{item.category}}</text></view><text class="status-tag {{item.statusTone}}">{{item.status}}</text></view>
      <text class="policy-card-title">{{item.title}}</text>
      <text class="policy-card-summary">{{item.summary}}</text>
      <view class="policy-meta"><text>{{item.issuer}}</text><text>{{item.publishDate}}</text></view>
      <view class="policy-card-foot"><text>适用地区：{{item.region}}</text><text>查看详情 ›</text></view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
